From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:28:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: Skl_Root follows the camera hook, the HUD background
 blends premultiplied and third person hides the help guide

The first-person body root is latched from the player and head pose hook_UpdateCameraForGameplay builds the view from, and every skipped root frame writes the last good transform. The HUD background gets its own premultiplied ImGui pipeline, the first 2D capture after a screen change is held one frame, and the camera source after a screen is logged. A short Options press no longer opens the world guide on the PS5, and the bow aim arc needs a real draw in third person. Built, untested on console.
